  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : \\(\\because 2 a+3 b-c=0\\) or \\(2 a+3 b+c=0\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow c= \\pm(2 a+3 b) \\\\\n& \\because \\quad a x+b y+c=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad a x+b y \\pm(2 a+3 b)=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad a(x \\pm 2)+b(y \\pm 3)=0 \\text { (family of lines) } \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad(-2,-3) \\quad \\text { or }(2,3)\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
